- Every item is traceable to the notes file; where owner or date is unclear or missing, say so briefly instead of guessing.
- Output a markdown file at lead/reader/work/notes-2026-10-12-extracted.md with two sections: '## Decisions' (one decision per line) and '## Actions' (a markdown table with columns Owner | Action | Due).

